00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:06,335
Deutsche Welle reports that Germany is widening deportations to Afghanistan.

2
00:00:06,285 --> 00:00:17,829
The article describes the case of an Afghan man in detention who fears removal, after Germany deported a person with no criminal record to Kabul earlier in the week.

3
00:00:17,829 --> 00:00:25,976
The policy raises difficult questions about migration control, human rights and safety under Taliban rule.

